id: pm-mkinft
title: "GH-950: item-addressing commands reject a consistent --id alias and misroute recovery"
description: Declare one SDK item-identifier input contract and project it across positional-id CLI commands without removing their canonical positional form.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:sdk",contracts,gh-950,grammar
created_at: "2026-08-09T20:27:22.194Z"
