close_reason: Uniform SDK-backed item addressing is implemented across the CLI.
body: "GitHub #950 reproduces show/get and test rejecting --id while create, close, notes, and activity accept it; generic unknown-option recovery points to different commands instead of correcting the chosen command. Every-status duplicate search found the positional grammar epic, flag lexicon, and older unknown-option work, but no canonical item for a shared item-addressing contract."
